        ]
      },
      "result_summary": "Thirty seconds did not distinguish tasks reliably. Held-seed performance rose above chance by 60 seconds and peaked at 120–240 seconds. Full-session accuracy fell to 8/12, showing that more elapsed behavior did not monotonically improve separability. Explore was recognized in…",
      "source_url": "https://github.com/yurei-so/research/blob/main/experiments/voxel-guidance/docs/labnotes/voxel-guidance-002-blinded-task-inference.md"
    },
    {
